# The Docker build context is the repository root. Keep private runtime
# directories, non-Python files, .git history, and credentials out of it.
# Untracked *.py files under the package are still included; keep private
# material out of source directories and inspect the build context.
**
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!src/agent_blotter/
!src/agent_blotter/*.py
